    "title": "AZUR SPACE 3G30-Advanced (HP) 產品規格書（DB 00010894-02，2026-03-24）：InGaP/GaAs/Ge 三結太空電池、源自 150 mm 鍺襯底；裸片、SCA／CIC 組件（矽旁路二極體、鍍銀 Kovar 互連片、蓋片、太空級膠）",
    "url": "https://www.azurspace.com/media/uploads/file_links/file/bdb_00010894-02-00_3g30-advanced_hp.pdf"
  },
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "azur_space_3g30_advanced_hp_datasheet_20260324_s1",
      "locator": "規格書 p.1 首段",
      "quote": "AZUR SPACE’s 3G30-Advanced bare solar cells and solar cell assemblies (“SCA”), or CICs (Cell-interconnect-coverglass) are the ideal solution for space power applications in conventional or in New Space segments."
    },
    {
      "id": "azur_space_3g30_advanced_hp_datasheet_20260324_s2",
      "locator": "規格書 p.1 第二段（3G30C-Advanced 裸片）",
      "quote": "The 3G30C-Advanced bare cell device is a space-qualified InGaP/GaAs/Ge triple-junction solar cell originating from a 150 mm germanium (Ge) substrate and provides 30% class beginning-of-life (BOL) efficiency."
    },
    {
      "id": "azur_space_3g30_advanced_hp_datasheet_20260324_s3",
      "locator": "規格書 p.1 第三段（3G30A 組件）",
      "quote": "The 3G30A assembly includes a bare 3G30C-Advanced solar cell, a corner-mounted silicon bypass diode, welded in-plane silver-coated Kovar interconnectors (“ICs”), and a 100 µm AR coated coverglass bonded with space-grade heritage adhesive."
    },
    {
      "id": "azur_space_3g30_advanced_hp_datasheet_20260324_s4",
      "locator": "規格書 p.1 第五段（鑑定與產地）",
      "quote": "The 3G30-Advanced technology, cells and assemblies are ECSS-E-ST-20-08C (Rev. 1) qualified. These devices are all produced in our mature MRL-10 Heilbronn facility."
    }
  ]
